1
00:00:30,480 --> 00:00:31,760
I won't let anything happen to you.

2
00:01:04,160 --> 00:01:04,880
You're awake.

3
00:01:05,760 --> 00:01:06,560
I think I...

4
00:01:07,280 --> 00:01:08,280
had a dream.

5
00:01:09,080 --> 00:01:09,760
I'm sorry.

6
00:01:10,760 --> 00:01:12,120
I failed to protect you.

7
00:01:13,960 --> 00:01:15,080
It will never happen again.

8
00:01:16,160 --> 00:01:17,320
Miao Miao, you're awake!

9
00:01:18,200 --> 00:01:19,960
You scared me to death, do you know that?

10
00:01:22,960 --> 00:01:23,360
Sis.

11
00:01:25,560 --> 00:01:26,040
Sis.

12
00:01:26,480 --> 00:01:28,040
You don't know how worried I was about you.

13
00:01:28,480 --> 00:01:30,760
I thought I'd never see you again.

14
00:01:31,760 --> 00:01:32,680
Don't worry.

15
00:01:33,160 --> 00:01:34,640
I'm still your one and only sister.

16
00:01:38,440 --> 00:01:39,480
Sis, are you feeling better now?

17
00:01:41,760 --> 00:01:42,440
Are you okay?

18
00:01:43,520 --> 00:01:44,080
I'm fine.

19
00:02:25,600 --> 00:02:27,360
Come, come, come.

20
00:02:27,960 --> 00:02:28,680
Have a seat.

21
00:02:29,840 --> 00:02:31,040
Drink some pomelo water.

22
00:02:31,120 --> 00:02:33,880
May it bless you to turn misfortune into fortune from now on.

23
00:02:35,640 --> 00:02:36,360
So simple.

24
00:02:36,640 --> 00:02:38,240
Since when did you become so superstitious?

25
00:02:38,600 --> 00:02:40,000
Superstition? Nonsense.

26
00:02:41,160 --> 00:02:42,840
Kids like you don't understand.

27
00:02:42,920 --> 00:02:44,920
Dear gods, please don't mind her ignorance.

28
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:46,480
Please bless her with safety and peace.

29
00:02:46,600 --> 00:02:48,400
Safety and peace, safety and peace.

30
00:02:48,480 --> 00:02:49,120
Sis.

31
00:02:49,400 --> 00:02:50,960
You should be thanking my brother-in-law instead.

32
00:02:52,840 --> 00:02:53,560
Exactly, exactly!

33
00:02:53,680 --> 00:02:55,200
Come, come, our great hero.

34
00:02:55,280 --> 00:02:57,280
Sit, please have a seat.

35
00:02:57,760 --> 00:02:59,880
I'll go prepare a big meal for you all!

36
00:03:01,880 --> 00:03:02,480
Hey, Ayi Te.

37
00:03:02,760 --> 00:03:03,720
Why are you just standing there?

38
00:03:03,800 --> 00:03:04,600
Come and help!

39
00:03:05,080 --> 00:03:05,560
Alright.

40
00:03:05,680 --> 00:03:06,800
Let's go, let's go.

41
00:03:10,080 --> 00:03:10,600
I'll come too!

42
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:16,920
Are you feeling okay?

43
00:03:18,320 --> 00:03:20,760
Are you sure saving me won't affect you?

44
00:03:21,320 --> 00:03:22,200
No, it won't.

45
00:03:22,440 --> 00:03:23,120
Besides,

46
00:03:23,840 --> 00:03:25,360
didn't your kiss replenish my energy?

47
00:03:26,880 --> 00:03:27,480
Come over here.

48
00:03:39,040 --> 00:03:39,640
Hao Ruichi.

49
00:03:40,080 --> 00:03:40,720
Hao Ruichi.

50
00:03:41,400 --> 00:03:43,160
Hao Ruichi, what's wrong? Hao Ruichi!

51
00:03:43,320 --> 00:03:44,000
Simple.

52
00:03:45,320 --> 00:03:46,120
Ai Yite.

53
00:04:01,440 --> 00:04:03,160
Still no signs of waking up?

54
00:04:05,120 --> 00:04:06,120
It's been two days already.

55
00:04:06,840 --> 00:04:08,120
My sister hasn't had a drop of water.

56
00:04:19,400 --> 00:04:20,040
Ai Yite.

57
00:04:21,320 --> 00:04:22,200
Step outside for a moment.

58
00:04:23,080 --> 00:04:23,960
I need to ask you something.

59
00:04:39,560 --> 00:04:40,320
Ai Yite.

60
00:04:41,760 --> 00:04:44,320
Is Hao Ruichi in this state because he saved me?

61
00:04:45,200 --> 00:04:45,800
He...

62
00:04:46,760 --> 00:04:48,000
...gave you his life energy.

63
00:04:57,160 --> 00:04:58,800
Is there any way to save him?

64
00:05:00,960 --> 00:05:02,600
His body was already weak on this star.

65
00:05:03,560 --> 00:05:06,240
Now that he's out of energy, I'm afraid...

66
00:05:08,400 --> 00:05:09,960
...I'm afraid his chances are slim.

67
00:05:11,600 --> 00:05:13,280
Ai Yite, please tell me how I can save him!

68
00:05:13,320 --> 00:05:14,400
I'll do anything.

69
00:05:14,480 --> 00:05:15,560
I'm begging you, Ai Yite.

70
00:05:15,600 --> 00:05:16,360
If you want to save him...

71
00:05:17,480 --> 00:05:18,720
...you must send him back.

72
00:05:24,040 --> 00:05:24,520
Then...

73
00:05:27,280 --> 00:05:28,880
...how do we send him back?

74
00:05:31,800 --> 00:05:32,800
When I came here...

75
00:05:33,360 --> 00:05:34,440
...the spaceship fell into the water.

76
00:05:35,240 --> 00:05:36,080
It's not damaged.

77
00:06:06,240 --> 00:06:07,280
The kitchen work is done.

78
00:06:07,360 --> 00:06:08,520
Take a break after you’re done.

79
00:06:09,640 --> 00:06:10,600
I'll watch the shop for a while.

80
00:06:10,680 --> 00:06:12,480
Go ahead and bring some food to Miaomiao and the others.

81
00:06:19,160 --> 00:06:19,960
Here...

82
00:06:20,960 --> 00:06:22,520
...are all my cooking notes.

83
00:06:23,960 --> 00:06:24,480
And...

84
00:06:25,080 --> 00:06:26,320
...all the cooking steps.

85
00:06:30,160 --> 00:06:30,920
Idiot.

86
00:06:31,360 --> 00:06:32,760
My cooking is already so delicious,

87
00:06:32,800 --> 00:06:33,960
...why would I need this?

88
00:06:37,560 --> 00:06:38,680
When making seafood noodles in the future...

89
00:06:39,640 --> 00:06:40,800
...remember to use less seasoning.

90
00:06:41,760 --> 00:06:43,240
Otherwise, it will ruin the seafood's flavor.

91
00:06:45,800 --> 00:06:46,680
And when washing dishes...

92
00:06:47,080 --> 00:06:48,120
...remember to wear gloves.

93
00:06:48,800 --> 00:06:49,480
It's getting cold.

94
00:06:49,680 --> 00:06:50,560
Just use hot water.

95
00:06:51,760 --> 00:06:53,120
And when there's no one around at night,

96
00:06:53,520 --> 00:06:54,520
close the store a bit earlier.

97
00:06:55,560 --> 00:06:57,160
The most, most, most important thing is,

98
00:06:59,080 --> 00:07:00,320
next time you hire someone,

99
00:07:01,480 --> 00:07:03,040
don’t trust people so easily.

100
00:07:10,640 --> 00:07:11,400
Ayet,

101
00:07:12,640 --> 00:07:14,320
you will come back, right?

102
00:07:14,760 --> 00:07:15,320
Of course.

103
00:07:15,800 --> 00:07:17,200
Blue Star can't hold me.

104
00:07:17,840 --> 00:07:18,920
I will definitely come back.

105
00:07:19,440 --> 00:07:19,960
Alright.

106
00:07:20,520 --> 00:07:21,520
Then I'll wait for you.

107
00:07:22,480 --> 00:07:24,680
If you're late coming back, you're so dead.

108
00:07:54,840 --> 00:07:55,600
Hao Ruichi,

109
00:07:59,440 --> 00:08:00,440
you're going back.

110
00:08:02,200 --> 00:08:03,440
Get better soon.

111
00:08:15,320 --> 00:08:15,840
Miao Miao,

112
00:08:16,800 --> 00:08:17,800
it's time.

113
00:08:18,840 --> 00:08:19,720
Let's go.

114
00:08:53,480 --> 00:08:54,040
Don't worry,

115
00:08:54,400 --> 00:08:55,480
he's going to be fine.

116
00:09:06,520 --> 00:09:07,160
What's wrong?

117
00:09:07,840 --> 00:09:09,920
He doesn’t seem to have a pulse.

118
00:09:11,240 --> 00:09:11,920
Hao Ruichi!

119
00:09:13,360 --> 00:09:14,040
Wake up!

120
00:09:14,480 --> 00:09:15,320
Wake up!

121
00:09:15,800 --> 00:09:17,120
You’re joking, right?

122
00:09:17,480 --> 00:09:19,240
No, no way.

123
00:09:19,320 --> 00:09:20,400
Hao Ruichi, wake up!

124
00:09:20,520 --> 00:09:21,760
You can't do this.

125
00:09:21,880 --> 00:09:23,720
Stop joking with me!

126
00:09:23,960 --> 00:09:24,920
Didn’t you say,

127
00:09:25,040 --> 00:09:27,200
didn’t you say you’d stay with me?

128
00:09:27,320 --> 00:09:30,080
Hao Ruichi, wake up for me!
